        <head>Holy Trinity Church.</head>
        <p>Holy Trinity Church.</p>
        <p>Pending on appointment to the money (say, the Holy Trini toPnr,,b Nlngazine , the Vicar han secured the essiniance of the Rae. John tiammornly, of Wenningtou- rood, Southport. Mr. Ifsmniernly wan for 25 years vicar of Allithwaite near Grange-overmands, but lesigoed the living about two years ago owing to increasing liestness. Thin infirmity, however, by no moans in.pricitates him from giving valuable /MIA, since in the Church services, as our congregation can testify.</p>
