        <p>PHOPOSED PHTHISIS HOSPITAL AT SANKEY. THE CLOSING OF INSANITARY PROPERTY. Alderman J•1111s EvAlrs in moving the coolirrention of the minutee of the Health Committee, pointed curt that (be connelitee bad been seriously coesidering the treatment of phttwais. Having • building at Sankey the Health Committee thought tLat it ought to he utilised for van. usetul porpu tie and no they wanted to Iwo iList the treatment of phtbisia There were 127 derails last year front phthisia, whereas there were only 91 from all other infectious diseases. There woitld be considerable expense incurred in maintaining the insti- tution at Sankey. However, before they could fully enter into the matter they would have to get the ont- sent of the Local Goveronient Board.</p>
