        <p>SERVICE BAND.—The second meeting of the above took piece on Monday evening in the Con- gregational School Vestry when a good comber of young people assembled. Miss Annie Miller occiipied the position of leader, end Mr. Ci. Willnn gave no address on "Conversion " which wee much Appreciated. Mr. 11. Reshton rendsred net, entitled " Behold me standing et the dour." Mrs. Willno also recited during the evening.</p>
