        <p>Mr. Steel also—m-s-de-.application on behalf Harry Boyle, for a similar extension in respe dancing rooms in Leghwireet. He pointed c the dancing claseescloeed at 10.30—and stow tins, to do so—but the rooms were occaaial</p>
